# YokiFrame vNext local caches and generated build outputs.
**/.yokiframe/
!**/.yokiframe/
**/.yokiframe/*

# Project Workflow Recipes are author-owned, reviewable source assets; other Workflow data is runtime state.
!**/.yokiframe/workflows/
!**/.yokiframe/workflows/recipes/
!**/.yokiframe/workflows/recipes/*.json
**/.yokiframe/workflows/runs/
**/.yokiframe/workflows/changes/
**/.yokiframe/workflows/approvals/
**/.yokiframe/workflows/artifacts/
**/.yokiframe/workflows.lock
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
YokiFrameWorkbench~/.artifacts*/
YokiFrameWorkbench~/**/.artifacts*/
YokiFrameWorkbench~/.validation-artifacts*/
YokiFrameWorkbench~/**/.validation-artifacts*/

# Package-local Runtime payloads are forbidden. Rebuildable tool output belongs to each project's .yokiframe cache.
WorkbenchRuntime~/
